      "content": "**Removed 18 duplicate tests** from `tests/tools/test_validate.py`: - 1 exact duplicate (test_collect_git_state_non_repo) - 17 near-duplicates (porcelain parsing, dirty policy, worktree readiness, extra_forbidden, receipt content-light) - **Preserved** 1 unique test (test_collect_git_state_porcelain_sha256) with no equivalent in dedicated file",
